# The lead form works out of the box: with nothing set here it posts through
# FormSubmit (https://formsubmit.co), which relays the enquiry straight to
# siteConfig.business.email. The first submission sends an activation email to
# that inbox — one click there and every later enquiry is delivered.
#
# Set VITE_LEAD_ENDPOINT to use your own endpoint instead. Anything that accepts
# a JSON POST and answers 2xx works:
#   · Formspree             https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx
#   · Google Apps Script     https://script.google.com/macros/s/xxx/exec
#   · your own API           https://api.rsfitclub.in/leads
# The payload shape is documented in src/utils/leads.ts.
#
# Never commit the real .env file.
VITE_LEAD_ENDPOINT=
